  "mobile.feature.map.body": "See where prices are moving, which districts have the deepest inventory, and where the nearest chargers are.",
  "mobile.feature.map.title": "District & EV hubs",
  "mobile.feature.offline.body": "Your watchlist, alerts and the last market snapshot are cached on the device — useful at a yard with bad coverage.",
  "mobile.feature.offline.title": "Works without signal",
  "mobile.feature.scan.body": "Point the camera at a plate and Motormila reads it on-device, then pulls the market record for that vehicle.",
